{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1284.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"b13ba14114499289b4a26535642a2c0952c88741c517cbec05d358eaa6f90ebb","ja":"私が高槻さんを攻撃してしまったせいね……。\nごめんなさい、混乱してしまって……。","zh":"都是因为我攻击了高槻同学吧……\n对不起，我当时太混乱了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1284.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"00d32751f6cc865e3a296bfe1554d9c4cc9afc9ac2f0823c0d00bebe4149b600","ja":"なかなか、思った通りに動かせないわね～……。\nあら、杏奈ちゃん。こんにちは♪","zh":"真不容易随心所欲地控制呢～……\n哎呀，是杏奈啊。你好呀♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1284.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"6b7bfcaf7e625b359d493e31c0c453cbaccf3145df8891bf780917f440f211bd","ja":"こんにちは……。\nあの……みんな、どうしてゲーム、を？","zh":"你好……。\n那个……大家为什么，在玩游戏呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1284.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"4726c04051d523edf323489e1998336129825c6bc7cf84ff66c43e25f10022c4","ja":"今度、配信で新作ゲームの宣伝を\nすることになったから、練習してたの。","zh":"下次要在直播里宣传新游戏，\n所以我就先练习了一下。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1284.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"50ad4914084ae32518c2dac9d8af7bed2a4d7ff142997e8db6075f4b2193be82","ja":"でも、なかなかうまくできなくて。「ミニゲーム\nばかりだから大丈夫」って言われてたのに……。","zh":"可是，总是不太顺利。明明别人跟我说\n“全都是小游戏，没问题的”……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1284.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"890ae259e07a23d30274f22f79b08043e302dc27c51adeed6443e7dc04c6fa3a","ja":"せめて、楽しそうな雰囲気が伝わるくらいに\nならないといけないわよね……。","zh":"至少得做到能把开心的氛围传达出去的\n程度才行呢……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1284.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"2123a46257be430e69672778d353379dab076bda596e0afdc6a1d8a1cdaeb35c","ja":"私、自信ないです……。","zh":"我没什么自信……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1284.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"0e686db882cd70d670ba1f38ca9f7ed27183b1cd7488d5fc30c02bcce449fe84","ja":"さっきも、ボタンをばばーって押さないといけない時に\nあわわ～ってなっちゃいましたし……。","zh":"刚才也是，在必须噼里啪啦连续按按键的时候，\n我都慌得手忙脚乱了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1284.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"e593ccb55d1bc259fbc6dc38a439166175bd28d92d6eb13a660bc33d45d0c753","ja":"……連打なら、親指をずらして押すと……\nいい、かも……です。","zh":"……连击的话，错开大拇指按的话……\n说不定……会比较好。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1284.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"289a3c367347bd9524487e4086915af2bf8e27abd3656d7742444058bafa7f01","ja":"なるほど……そういえば、亜美と真美が\n言っていたけど、望月さんはゲームが上手なのよね？","zh":"原来如此……说起来，亚美和真美\n提过望月同学很擅长玩游戏吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1284.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"1ee497805c60079d704a9dc74eaae4cd3c3d6082495b8d10ef777cf7046fc1a5","ja":"それじゃあ、杏奈ちゃんに教えてもらったら、\nもうちょっと上手にできるようになるかも！","zh":"那要是让杏奈教教我的话，\n说不定就能做得更好一点了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1284.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"55d3e4f6d597767b63dea0f66655b1dc483e6b837d4596a3b2050cc7c3baa56a","ja":"えっ、杏奈が……やよいちゃんたちを……！？","zh":"诶，杏奈把……弥生她们给……！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
